## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of arguments).
Let mutable data be a new Seq of Int.
Let mutable k be 0.
While k is less than 1000:
    Push 195 to data.
    Push 169 to data.
    Set k to k + 1.
Let mutable sum be 0.
Let mutable r be 0.
While r is less than n:
    If validUtf8(data):
        Set sum to sum + 1.
    Set r to r + 1.
Show sum.
